  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Finance Integrity and Governance - Connecting Frontier Issues FFD4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project on Finance, Integrity, and Governance  - Connecting Frontier Issues for the fourth Financing for Development Conference in 2025 (FFD4). UNDP will leverage its extensive country presence, convening power and integrator role to facilitate technical conversations among UN member states, researchers, and practitioners on ensuring financial integrity in financing for development. The technical conversations will provide a space to examine emerging issues in the lead-up to FFD4 in mid-2025 and will serve as a co-creative knowledge track that helps level the playing field - separate from but in support of member states&#x2019; actual negotiations.</narrative>
  </description>
